roof_vocab.B1_WORK_DESC:
Restoration of the public market to include following per previous approved Certificate of Appropriateness Historic & Cultural Landmarks Commission:
1. Repair masonry;
2. Repair and selectively replace in-kind the roof;
3. Repair and selectively replace in-kind windows; 4. Repair the foundation;
5. Repair and selectively replace in-kind wood trim; 6. Reinstate doors and entrances;
7. Repair exterior stucco;
8. Rehabilitate accessory shed structure; 9. Install new HVAC system;
10. Replace electrical system; and
11. Upgrade plumbing system.

